<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105768" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρῡχόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wear out, emaciate,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πᾶν σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					6.488
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν Ἑλλάδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					3.2.8
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυχνοῦν</span> (fort. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυχοῦν</span>), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπονεῖν, ἰσχναίνειν</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.147
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος τρυχοῦται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Mimn.
					2.12
				</span></i>
			; mostly in pf.
			part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρυχωμένος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				807b
			</span></i> (v.l.), etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ πολέμῳ κατὰ πάντα τετρ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸτῶν πολέμων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.11.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαιὸν καὶ τετρ. δίκτυον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.14
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυχωθῆναι τὸ σῶμα,</span>
			viz. by disease, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>.</div>
